<title>POLAND: Polish August currency reserves dip to $21.93 bln.</title>
<headline>Polish August currency reserves dip to $21.93 bln.</headline>
<text>
<p>POLISH RESERVES (bln dollars)   AUGUST     JULY    AUG 1995</p>
<p>    Official reserves		 N/A	17.80     11.74</p>
<p>    Net reserves		     21.93     21.96     17.40</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures in billions of dollars. Official reserves are those held by the state. Net reserves mean the total amount of hard currencies in the whole banking system.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
